{"id":"70ababa14ca40e13","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Essential Supremum","display":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum — ZFC Measure4 Essential Supremum","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum","58-df-zfc-measure7-essential-supremum"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum — ZFC Measure4 Essential Supremum","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum</span><span>58-df-zfc-measure7-essential-supremum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum — ZFC Measure4 Essential Supremum"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,f,a\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,f,a\\in V\\)</span> (measure space, function, and value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialSupremum}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialSupremum}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\">\\(\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}\\)</span> (sigma-algebra predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md\">../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span> (measure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialSupremum}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,f,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\overline{\\mathbb R})\\land\n\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)&gt;b\\}\\in\\Sigma)\\land\na\\in\\overline{\\mathbb R}\\land\n\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\na\\leq b\\leftrightarrow\\mu(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)&gt;b\\})=0\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialSupremum}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,f,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\overline{\\mathbb R})\\land\n\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)&gt;b\\}\\in\\Sigma)\\land\na\\in\\overline{\\mathbb R}\\land\n\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\na\\leq b\\leftrightarrow\\mu(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)&gt;b\\})=0\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The cut of real essential upper bounds determines the extended-real value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>, including the cases <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a=\\pm\\infty\">\\(a=\\pm\\infty\\)</span>; no convention for the infimum of an empty set is left implicit.</li>\n<li>The measure7 essential-supremum variant is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}$ (sigma-algebra predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-sigma-algebra.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$ (measure predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu,f,a\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialSupremum}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}essential\\text{-}supremum} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4EssentialSupremum}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu,f,a)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{SigmaAlgebra}(\\Sigma,X)\\land\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\Sigma)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,\\overline{\\mathbb R})\\land\n\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)>b\\}\\in\\Sigma)\\land\na\\in\\overline{\\mathbb R}\\land\n\\forall b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\Bigl(\na\\leq b\\leftrightarrow\\mu(\\{x\\in X\\mid f(x)>b\\})=0\n\\Bigr)\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"a","display":false},{"tex":"a=\\pm\\infty","display":false}],"bytes":1665,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2594","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum.md|58-df-zfc-measure4-essential-supremum]]（batch02）